==Finnish==

===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|fi|orv|грамота}}, from {{der|fi|grc|γράμματα|t=letters, writing}}. <ref>{{R:Hakkinen 2004}}</ref> According to Häkkinen (2018), the word was borrowed through {{bor|fi|et|raamat}},<ref>Häkkinen, Kaisa. ''Suomi on kuuden kerroksen kieli'' (2018). ''Tiede''.</ref> to which it is at least definitely related.

